Error [jet.SingleUseDropped]: This value still owes `consume`
  --> tests/ui/single_use_discarded.jet:7:13
    |
  7 | run: fn() { _: acquire("db") }
    |             ^
 Why: This value's type is `#SingleUse`, so it carries a job that has to be done — discarding it into `_` skips that job before it's done
 Fix: Bind it to a name, then consume it exactly once — or write `#Unsafe("reason") { consume(...) }` to discard it deliberately
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0140
